  "subject": "Welcome to Hôtel Dar Zitouna",
  "text": 
" 




WELCOME, SARA

Hi Sara,

Thank you for staying with us. We are so happy to have you at Hôtel Dar Zitouna, and we will take good care of you.

To say thank you, here is a little something for you:

Free breakfast

For two

Your code: DAR-24

Valid until December 31, 2026

See my offer https://hoetel.test/o/1

Warmly,
The Hôtel Dar Zitouna team

You are receiving this email because you shared your address with Hôtel Dar Zitouna.

Hôtel Dar Zitouna · 12 Rue de la Médina, Tunis

Unsubscribe https://hoetel.test/u/token"
,
}
`;

