0a;text-align:left;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">For two</p><p class="e-fg" style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;margin:12px 0 0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:left;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Your code<!-- -->:<!-- --> <strong style="font-family:&#x27;JetBrains Mono&#x27;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;letter-spacing:0.08em" dir="ltr">DAR-24</strong></p><p class="e-mut" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:8px 0 0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#737373;text-align:left;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Valid until December 31, 2026</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:24px 0 0;text-align:left"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://hoetel.test/o/1" class="e-pr e-cta" style="line-height:24px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#0f766e;border:1px solid #0f766e;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;padding:14px 28px;padding-top:14px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:28px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:466.6666666666667%;mso-text-raise:21" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:10.5px">Claim my gift</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:466.6666666666667%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="e-fg" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:28px 0 0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:left;margin-top:28px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Warmly,<br/>The Hôtel Dar Zitouna team</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="e-pad e-bd" style="padding:20px 32px 32px;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin-top:24px"><tbody><tr><td><p class="e-mut" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#737373;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">You are receiving this email because you shared your address with Hôtel Dar Zitouna.</p><p class="e-mut" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:8px 0 0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#737373;text-align:left;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Hôtel Dar Zitouna<!-- --> · <!-- -->12 Rue de la Médina, Tunis</p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:8px 0 0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Sans&#x27;, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:left;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://hoetel.test/u/token" class="e-mut" style="color:#737373;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
,
  "subject": "Happy birthday, Sara",
  "text": 
" 




HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SARA

Everyone at Hôtel Dar Zitouna is thinking of you today. To celebrate, here is a small gift for your next stay.

Free breakfast

For two

Your code: DAR-24

Valid until December 31, 2026

Claim my gift https://hoetel.test/o/1

Warmly,
The Hôtel Dar Zitouna team

You are receiving this email because you shared your address with Hôtel Dar Zitouna.

Hôtel Dar Zitouna · 12 Rue de la Médina, Tunis

Unsubscribe https://hoetel.test/u/token"
,
}
