  "subject": "How was your stay at Hôtel Dar Zitouna?",
  "text": 
" 




HOW WAS YOUR STAY?

Hi Sara,

Thank you for choosing Hôtel Dar Zitouna. Your opinion helps us welcome you even better next time. It takes less than a minute.

Share my feedback https://hoetel.test/o/1

Warmly,
The Hôtel Dar Zitouna team

You are receiving this email because you shared your address with Hôtel Dar Zitouna.

Hôtel Dar Zitouna · 12 Rue de la Médina, Tunis

Unsubscribe https://hoetel.test/u/token"
,
}
