  "subject": "Your offer at Hôtel Dar Zitouna ends soon",
  "text": 
" 




YOUR OFFER IS WAITING

Hi Sara,

A quick reminder from Hôtel Dar Zitouna: your offer is still yours, and we would love to welcome you back.

Free breakfast

For two

Your code: DAR-24

Valid until December 31, 2026

Use my offer https://hoetel.test/o/1

Warmly,
The Hôtel Dar Zitouna team

You are receiving this email because you shared your address with Hôtel Dar Zitouna.

Hôtel Dar Zitouna · 12 Rue de la Médina, Tunis

Unsubscribe https://hoetel.test/u/token"
,
}
`;

